## 🎨 **Kiosk Development Guidelines**

### **Design Requirements (STRICT)**
```css
/* Minimum requirements for kiosk display */
.kiosk-component {
  font-size: 18px;        /* MINIMUM for standing users */
  font-weight: 600;       /* Bold for visibility */
  line-height: 1.4;       /* Readable spacing */
  color: #1a1a1a;         /* High contrast */
}

/* Sticky interface positioning */
.sticky-interface {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 0;
  height: 15vh;           /* 15% of viewport */
  width: 100%;
  z-index: 1000;
}
```

### **Voice-Only Interaction Rules**
- ❌ **NO** touch/click handlers
- ❌ **NO** close buttons or dismiss actions
- ❌ **NO** scrollable content
- ✅ **YES** to visual feedback only
- ✅ **YES** to audio-driven state changes

